# evidence-for: FR-019, FR-012
#
# D-136. The flag pass carried "Same join and same six-line cap as the decorator
# pass above". The cap is the same and the accumulation is the same; the
# completion test is not. The decorator pass counts through call_depth_delta,
# which skips the parens inside a `#` comment or a string literal (e4e0775 put
# it there); the flag pass counts the raw text. The sentence was true when it
# was written at 3aa48f7, where both passes counted raw, and false from e4e0775
# on. The comment now names the difference and says why nothing a reader sees
# turns on it: CLI_ARG_END cuts the literal scan at the first `)` or `#`
# whichever count stopped the join, and those are the very characters the two
# counts disagree about.
#
